    "headline": "India proposes 8 guardrails in softening of stance on plurilateral pacts at WTO",
    "body": "India has proposed eight safeguards for plurilateral agreements at the WTO. These safeguards aim to preserve consensus-based decision making and the multilateral charter. Non-participants' rights and agency must also be protected by these measures. India previously opposed plurilateral trade agreements, advocating for exceptions rather than norms. The proposed safeguards seek to build confidence in the WTO as an inclusive institution.",
