    "headline": "Centre eases export compliance for shipments up to Rs 3 lakh, seeks 5-year RoDTEP extension",
    "body": "Exporters will not need a registration certificate for shipments valued up to three lakh rupees. This change reduces compliance burdens for new and small businesses entering overseas markets. The government is also seeking a five-year extension for the RoDTEP export promotion scheme. Discussions are underway to ensure predictability and examine potential changes to the mission. A framework for Brand India and sectoral branding is currently being developed.",
